OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA milder start, though with
OL,6,Fsome patchy rain, this becoming more
OL,7,Fpersistent and sometimes heavy with
OL,8,Fblustery winds. Rain clearing
OL,9,Fsoutheastwards during the afternoon
OL,10,Fallowing for some sunshine for the
OL,11,Fremainder of the day, but remaining
OL,12,Fbreezy. Cooling down too.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells with light
OL,15,Fshowers around to start this evening.
OL,16,FFurther showers developing overnight,
OL,17,Fespecially in the west. Meanwhile,
OL,18,Fwinds easing. A chillier night than
OL,19,Fthe last.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
