OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA mixed day with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers, but also with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine in-between. Showers and winds
OL,8,Feasing later in the afternoon. Feeling
OL,9,Fcooler than on Friday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloud
OL,12,Fand rain arriving from the southwest
OL,13,Fon Sunday. Some patchy light, drizzly
OL,14,Frain continuing into Monday, then rain
OL,15,Fclearing to brighter skies on Tuesday.
OL,16,FFeeling milder with southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
